From 931f53d245d56f37dec8061a9af92e8c94d67636 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: crazynucfan <127292955+crazynucfan@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 23:08:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] arm64: negroni_defconfig: watchdog built in, hung task
 detector on

The kexec loader on negroni can only fall back from a bad kernel if that
kernel reboots instead of hanging, so the APSS watchdog must be there
before any module loads. The hung task detector is what would have named
the wait in a boot that stalls before userspace; it costs nothing on a
node.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 arch/arm64/configs/negroni_defconfig | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/negroni_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/negroni_defconfig
index fede9713b..8accef6a9 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/negroni_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/negroni_defconfig
@@ -746,7 +746,7 @@ CONFIG_WATCHDOG=y
 CONFIG_WATCHDOG_CORE=y
 CONFIG_XILINX_WATCHDOG=m
 CONFIG_XILINX_WINDOW_WATCHDOG=m
-CONFIG_QCOM_WDT=m
+CONFIG_QCOM_WDT=y
 CONFIG_PM8916_WATCHDOG=m
 CONFIG_MFD_SPMI_PMIC=y
 CONFIG_MFD_QCOM_PM8008=m
@@ -1325,3 +1325,4 @@ CONFIG_CORESIGHT_STM=m
 CONFIG_CORESIGHT_CPU_DEBUG=m
 CONFIG_CORESIGHT_CTI=m
 CONFIG_MEMTEST=y
+CONFIG_DETECT_HUNG_TASK=y
-- 
2.43.0

